    "body": "### Push retry cannot resolve listing conflicts\n\n**Medium Severity**\n\n<!-- DESCRIPTION START -->\nEvery publish and prune rewrites the root `index.html` listing. Concurrent updates conflict on that file; `rebase` with `allowFail` swallows the conflict, so the five retries never recover and the review is not pushed.\n<!-- DESCRIPTION END -->\n\n<!-- BUGBOT_BUG_ID: ceb7f9d5-4b9d-4232-a677-18a3e4758d41 -->\n\n<!-- LOCATIONS START\nscripts/pages-review.ts#L272-L286\nscripts/pages-review.ts#L231-L236\nLOCATIONS END -->\n<details>\n<summary>Additional Locations (1)</summary>\n\n- [`scripts/pages-review.ts#L231-L236`](https://github.com/matemolnar8/comprehende/blob/16565def6a52a638a09689dc5f6ddfe45cab1504/scripts/pages-review.ts#L231-L236)\n\n</details>\n\n<div><a href=\"https://cursor.com/open?\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-light.png\"><img alt=\"Fix in Cursor\" width=\"115\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://cursor.com/agents?\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-light.png\"><img alt=\"Fix in Web\" width=\"99\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a></div>\n\n\n<sup>Reviewed by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/bugbot) for commit 16565def6a52a638a09689dc5f6ddfe45cab1504. Configure [here](https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot).</sup>\n",
